# Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** August 6, 2026

## Privacy Policy for Iron Ridge

Thank you for playing **Iron Ridge**. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected when you use Iron Ridge and how that information is used.

### 1. Information We Collect

Depending on the features you use, Iron Ridge may collect the following information:

* Basic device information (such as device model, operating system, and app version)
* Gameplay data, including game progress, achievements, and settings
* Crash reports and diagnostic information to improve stability
* Google Play Games account information, if you choose to sign in using Google Play Games Services

Iron Ridge does not intentionally collect sensitive personal information.

### 2. How We Use Information

Information collected may be used to:

* Save and restore game progress
* Provide achievements and leaderboards
* Improve gameplay and performance
* Fix bugs and technical issues
* Prevent fraud and abuse

### 3. Google Play Games Services

If you sign in using Google Play Games Services, Google may collect and process information according to its own Privacy Policy. Please review Google's Privacy Policy for additional information.

### 4. Third-Party Services

Iron Ridge may use third-party services that collect information in accordance with their own privacy policies. These services may include:

* Google Play Games Services
* Google Play Store
* Google Play Services

If advertising or analytics services are added in future updates, this Privacy Policy will be updated accordingly.

### 5. Data Sharing

We do not sell your personal information.

Information may be shared only:

* When required by law
* To protect our legal rights
* With service providers necessary to operate the game

### 6. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure.

### 7. Children's Privacy

Iron Ridge is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information, please contact us so appropriate action can be taken.

### 8. Your Rights

Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion of applicable data.

### 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.

